   "notes": "Same M9 base as the spent-media medium, here supplemented with a defined 5 mg/L pantothenate (vitamin B5) - the single tested concentration referenced in the medium id. As above, the article contains NO nitrogen source (NH4Cl/ammonium), NO CaCl2, and NO trace metals/vitamin mix (verified by full-text search), so the ammonium/calcium/Co2+/Cu/Fe/Mn/Zn entries in current_components are unsupported by this paper and were dropped. Phosphate values reported verbatim despite an apparent ~1000x units typo. No reductant/anaerobic gas - Variovorax grows aerobically."
